# Day bundles of real people are health data, and this repository is public and
# is what Render builds from.  Tracked: the synthetic demo day, the schema, and
# Subject demo's days, fitted coefficients and display label (published with
# the owner's approval, 2026-11-14).  Any other subject copied here stays on
# this machine, and so does a fit report.
backend/bundles/*
!backend/bundles/demo/
!backend/bundles/bundle.schema.json
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/
backend/bundles/subject_demo/*
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/20??-??-??.json
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/params.json
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/subject.json
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/templates.json
!backend/bundles/subject_demo/fitness_records.json

# Mockups built from a real person's day stay local; the synthetic one is tracked.
docs/design/mockups/*
!docs/design/mockups/day-view-demo.html
